  "completion": "MAINLINE-046 filed: environmental evidence, declared service year, retained-strength/SF scenarios for 022d and 041, mitigation/replacement masses and NFI. Qualified installed life remains unknown.",
  "at": "2026-10-20T04:35:05.017208-07:00",
  "body": "MAINLINE-046 complete; QUESTIONABLE/PROJECTION. No installed one-year or ten-year film life is demonstrated. The 022d 5% and resized 041 5%/019 films require retained fractions 0.794753/0.874673/0.923186. Both plies and actual ply stresses are reconstructed.\n\nSourced humidity, visible/UV, protected-yarn/coating, creep and fatigue records support explicit 1/5/10-year scenarios, not an identified service-aging law. The warehouse endpoint exponential gives ten-year nominal film SF 1.084071/0.985018/0.933256. A separate 0.5%-annual combined-loss requirement gives 1.196737/1.087390/1.030248; the hot/full-restraint sensitivity gives 1.092731/0.995706/0.944784.\n\nAt 041, scaled seams plus OD4/white protection cost 95.751 kg. Hot-film SF1 correction adds 0.714/9.165 kg reinforcement. Equipment/protection exceeds the existing 100 kg allocation; no flotation credit. SK99 leads the chemistry-only static mass comparison, but grade-specific creep blocks a ten-year qualification. Protected replaceable PBO is the planning development route, with measured retention and replacement-interface evidence still required.\n\nForty-three calculator checks, 42 independent comparisons, six invariants and 113 pin checks pass. Manifest pins 117 files; 22 new NFI entries and inherited registers remain open. No time budget. Brief says stop and file; no successor. No out-of-band contact, wake or restore.",
